    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>This website (acrepairmiddletownde.com) respects your privacy. We do not sell personal information. Contact details you provide by phone or form are used only to respond to service requests and improve our local service.</p>
      <p>We may use standard analytics and server logs to understand site performance. Cookies may be used for basic functionality. By using this site you consent to this limited data use.</p>
      <p>For questions about this policy, contact us at the phone number listed on this website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
